      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1pyo0a2'
    '|a||Height is the odd one. Tall people earn more on average, and nobody grows taller to dodge a tax.':
