      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:alp2sc'
    '|a||Almost nobody wants that tax. Their point: either we tax height, or our idea of fairness isn''t only about outcomes.':
