      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1ds21hs'
    '|a||So the theorem''s transfer can''t be built. Where does that leave a real town that wants the fair point?':
